 ],
 "text": "As of 15 November 2026, the Assembly lists eight occupied reserved seats: five for women, one for Ulema/Mashaikh, one for overseas state subjects, and one for technocrats/professionals. There is no separate non-Muslim/minority reserved seat. All eight belong to the Assembly elected in 2026, not to by-elections. The Assembly’s list identifies Muhammad Mazhir Saeed’s party as AJKJUI; contemporary reporting says he won on a PML-N ticket, which is reflected in the coalition field. The Assembly directory’s party entries for Farzana Yaqoob and Zobia Khurshid conflict with its own member list and election reporting; their reported election party was PPP."
}